    "body": "Alternative to #2163.\r\n\r\nSince BIP8 has not had any updates in over five years and there currently does not seem to be work on advancing it to Complete, I’m proposing to move BIP8 to the Closed status. If the authors are still working on advancing this BIP to Complete, they can reply either here or in #2163 in the next four weeks. On or after 2026-08-31 this PR may be merged if the authors do not reply.\r\n\r\ncc: @shaolinfry, @luke-jr as the BIP owners, but anyone’s review is welcome.",
